X-SOURCE-ID:luma_toronto_discover
SUMMARY:Midnight Rush Toronto
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261113T203000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261114T040000
UID:evt-2jWvJd4ntxQQdGn@events.lu.ma
DESCRIPTION:Address:\nSweat and Tonic\nToronto\, ON\nCanada\n\nSigning up 
 as a team? Each person can register individually\, then adds the names of 
 who they want on their squad. Once everyone on the team has signed up\, we
 ’ll match you together. No team yet? No worries\, you’ll be randomly p
 aired with one.\n\nAn overnight relay unlike anything else.\n\nMidnight Ru
 sh is back. This isn't your typical race\, it's a 60 kilometer overnight r
 elay that turns Sweat and Tonic Front/Spadina into an all night running fe
 stival.\n\nRun in teams of 4 or go solo. Each loop is 5K\, finish yours\, 
 tag in your next teammate\, then head back to the crowd to eat\, recover\,
  and cheer on…\n\nHosted by Hornet Energy
LOCATION:Sweat and Tonic\, Terrace Level\, 486 Front St W Unit SF 32 and 3
 3\, Toronto\, ON M5V 0V2\, Canada
URL:https://luma.com/qzqryaaf
X-SOURCE:Luma Toronto Discover
END:VEVENT
