SUMMARY:Ontario Climate Summit 2026 - by Toronto Environmental Alliance
LOCATION:various venues
DESCRIPTION:More info:
  https://www.tickettailor.com/events/urbanclimatealliance/2384421\n\nHoste
 d by Toronto Environmental Alliance
  (https://www.torontoenvironment.org/)\n\nThe Ontario Climate Summit is a
  gathering of local climate action organizations from across the province
  to come together and work for stronger climate action in communities
  across Ontario. Climate activists from across Ontario will connect\,
  build skills\, and collaborate to drive inclusive\, effective\,
  sustainable\, and coordinated climate action in Ontario’s
  municipalities.
END:VEVENT
