SUMMARY:Canada-U.S. Tariffs Discussion - by Democracy by the Bonfire
LOCATION:955 Lake Shore Blvd W
DESCRIPTION:More info: https://luma.com/kxn1p515\n\nHosted by Democracy by
  the Bonfire (https://www.instagram.com/democracybythebonfire/)\n\nAre you
  worried about what's going on between Trump and Carney's trade talks?
  Want to learn more about the drama? Come sit by the fire\, roast some
  marshmallows\, and have some thought-provoking discussions about what we
  can do better as a society. Snacks provided! Open to youth aged 18-30. 
END:VEVENT
