DESCRIPTION:Address:\nAnima\nToronto\, ON\nCanada\n\nSpend the evening wit
 h us at anima Volume 2 for a short film screening\, some good company\, an
 d a little friendly competition. We'll have board games\, snacks\, and dri
 nks on hand\, with plenty of time to meet new people\, catch up\, and conn
 ect.\nProduced by Tomato Productions\, the short documentary follows Alish
 a Wong and Sama Mazraeh through a show day during anima Volume 1\, offerin
 g a behind-the-scenes look at what goes into bringing a Hearing Parallels 
 music experience to life. From the flurry of activity to the many people w
 orking behind the scenes\, the film captures the energy\, collaboration\,
 …\n\nHosted by Alisha Wong\, Christophe Sabat & TOMATO PRODUCTIONS
