 rong\nVJ Amir Nian\n\nTo Arrange Special Packages & Table Reservations - 
 wigglyevents@gmail.com mailto:wigglyevents@gmail.com (sold separately fro
 m admission)\n\nATM on site\nFull Bar Service\n19+ event\n\nHosted by: To
 ronto House Community / Wiggly Events / Manzone & Strong / Sunshine Frequ
 encies / Wiggle Room Toronto\n\n~ WiGGLE RESPONSIBLY ~\nWe have a strict 
 code of conduct and reserve the right to refuse anyone at any time. Wiggl
 e Room is a Safer Dance Space. We take this very seriously. We encourage 
