DESCRIPTION:We invite you to join us for a general graduate studies admiss
 ions drop in hour! Join us to ask any questions that you might have about 
 York University and our graduate admissions process.\nParticipants are abl
 e to ask questions via the Q&A feature\, and a representative will answer 
 each question out loud.\nPlease note that during these sessions we will no
 t be able to answer any questions about Schulich School of Business progra
 ms\, Osgoode Law School programs\, or the Professional Accounting diploma 
 (PACC). For all other questions about graduate diplomas\, master’s progr
 ams\, and doctoral degrees\, we look forward to having you attend the even
 t.\nRegistration is required. To RSVP or learn more\, visit yorku.zoom.us/
 meeting/register ( https://yorku.zoom.us/webinar/register/WN_6jFik-dOR9qhN
 dITgBFjGw ).\nLearn more about our graduate programs at yorku.ca/gradstudi
 es/program-contacts ( http://yorku.ca/gradstudies/program-contacts )/\n
