SUMMARY: PL Pop-Up: The Piano Music of David T. Little
DESCRIPTION:Piano Lunaire presents this portrait pop-up concert\, showcas
 ing the piano works of GRAMMY-nominated composer David T. Little on the e
 ve of the Canadian premiere of his opera\, "Dog Days". Pianists Adam Sher
 kin\, Stephanie Chua and violinist Roan Ma present Little's complete pian
 o works plus a piece for violin and electronics. The composer will be in 
 attendance.\n\nPROGRAMME:\n\nHang Together for solo piano (2022)\nAccumul
 ation of Purpose (Six Studies for solo piano) (2017)\nElegy (monsters are
  real) for solo piano (2016)\nHellhound (2013) for violin and electronics
 \n\nTICKETS: www.simpletix.com/e/pl-pop-up-the-piano-music-of-david-t-lit
 tl-tickets-297747 https://www.simpletix.com/e/pl-pop-up-the-piano-music-o
 f-david-t-littl-tickets-297747\n\nA 60-minute recital featuring some of t
 he composer’s most distinctive music for solo piano and solo violin (with
  electronics). Tickets: $30. Seating is limited to 40 so please purchase 
 tickets in advance as is possible.\n\nA few more details:\nNo dress code 
 in effect. Begins promptly at 7pm\; ends at 8pm. Complimentary bar (beer\
