 e Café Princess menu**\n**\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\
 -\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-**\n\n**###** **📍 LOCATION: CAFÉ PRINCESS**\n
 \n* **5590 Yonge Street\, North York**\n* **Across the street from** **FIN
 CH SUBWAY STATION**\n**near Shoppers Drug Mart**\n\n**###** ***📅*** **D
 AY:** ***Every*** ***Wednesday***\n\n* **🕡 Time: 6:30 PM – 8:45 PM** 
 **⏰**\n\n**Please register ASAP** **if you want to attend on Sept 30th s
 o we can save your spot!**\n\n***We had roughly 80 people sign up for the 
 last two events... but we only have space for 30 people max.***\n**\\-\\-\
 \-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-
