 ing/practicing ENGLISH or KOREAN**\n3. **✅ Tell us your level: Beginner\
 , Intermediate\, Advanced or Expert**\n4. **✅** **Buy 1 item from the Ca
 fé Princess Menu** **(This is the only cost if this is your 1st or 2nd cl
 ass. There is an additional $5 fee starting from your third class onwards)
