 led by an award-winning certified teacher***\n* ***🗣️ Structured conv
 ersation activities with native and fluent speakers***\n* ***🎲 Board ga
 mes and social activities to practice language naturally***\n* ***🤝 Mak
 e new friends while improving your communication skills***\n\n**👨‍
 🏫** **MEET YOUR TEACHER & HOST**\n**###** **Learn From an Expert Langua
 ge Teacher**\n\n***John Dias (OCT\, PhD researcher\, MA\, BEd\, HBA & EELC
 ) is an award-winning certified language teacher with 10+ years experience
