SUMMARY:LSP: Your New Home - Life After Canadian Permanent Residence
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261119T191500
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261119T201500
UID:6af22f739b955d531f7e4528@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Did you get your PR status recently? Is it still in process? A
 re you planning to do it soon? This session is for you!\nAfter this sessio
 n\, you will know:\nwhat to do after arriving in Canada\n(for landed immig
 rants)\nhow to update documents with your new immigration status\n(for for
 mer temporary residents)\nhow to track your physical presence for PR card 
 renewal or citizenship\nabout free services and programs\nThis session is 
 available online as well. For more information and to register\, contact 
 LSP Program Worker Shane at saquino@culturelink.ca or 416-931-6536\nIn par
 tnership with Immigration\, Refugees and Citizenship Canada\, CultureLink
  Settlement & Community Services & Toronto Public Library.
LOCATION:Eatonville
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6af22f739b955d531f7e4528
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Young Adults
END:VEVENT
