BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Events": "https://events.yorku.ca/events/es-phd-research-day-2/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:events
SUMMARY:ES PhD Research Day
DTSTART:20261120T050000Z
DTEND:20261121T050000Z
DTSTAMP:20261109T181600Z
UID:MEC-61f3024ed641390e498517b310f7a378@events.yorku.ca
RECURRENCE-ID:20261120T050000Z
SEQUENCE:6
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://events.yorku.ca/wp-content/uploads/2026/
 10/Research-day-1200x627-1-scaled.jpg
CATEGORIES:Faculty of Environmental &amp\; Urban Change
CLASS:PUBLIC
CREATED:20261109
DESCRIPTION:PhESSA\, the ES PhD Program\, and the Faculty of Environmental
  and Urban Change are pleased to announce ES PhD Research Day 2026. The da
 y will showcase the rich diversity of work being done by PhD students in E
 nvironmental Studies to address the complex social\, ecological\, economic
 \, spiritual\, technological\, and political conditions of our time.\n\nTh
 e day’s theme\, (Re)Place\, (Re)Frame\, (Re)Claim\, gathers critical and
  creative responses to the overlapping crises of our built\, conceptual\, 
 and natural environments locally and globally\, highlighting interdiscipli
 nary perspectives and intersectional justice in doctoral research.\n\nThis
  is a day-long\, in-person event that seeks to foster community among PhD 
 students as well as with faculty in EUC and the larger research community 
 at York. Stay tuned for more details!\n
LAST-MODIFIED:20261109
PRIORITY:5
TRANSP:OPAQUE
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/es-phd-research-day-2/
X-SOURCE:York University
END:VEVENT
