 and engaging opportunity for drop-in participants of all ages to play\, ex
 perience\, and learn about a variety of musical instruments. Expert instru
 ctors will be on hand to assist\, demonstrate\, and answer questions.\nDro
 p in. No registration required. Children under 9 years old must be accomp
 anied by their parents or guardians.\nCommunity Music Schools of Toronto i
