DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261120T160000
UID:6abe6e51ea50a10050a5d050@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Fancy Cat is a dance-theatre musical for children.  The perfo
 rmance follows a gender-expansive Grade 3 student navigating belonging\, s
 elf-expression\, and friendship.  Playful\, funny\, and heartfelt\, the w
 ork invites young audiences to explore what it means to be brave\, kind\, 
 and fully themselves.  After the performance\, children and families are 
 invited to Dance\, Sing\, and Play together in a joyful interactive worksh
 op.  All ages welcome.  Performance runs from 2-3pm followed by a worksh
 op 3-4pm.  No registration required.
LOCATION:Agincourt\, Main Program Room.
