SUMMARY:3D Design and Print Painting For Kids 9+\, Part 1 (TinkerCAD)
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261120T153000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261120T163000
UID:6ac5447f96ec3a003ad8b0b3@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:For children ages 9 +. Join us for Part 1 of a fun and intera
 ctive event where kids can unleash their creativity using TinkerCAD. This 
 hands-on class will introduce children to the world of 3D design and model
 ing in a playful and engaging way. No prior experience is needed - just co
 me ready to have a blast! (Don't forget to also register for Part 2 where 
 we paint what we designed in Part 1!)\nInformation Collection Notice:\nThe
  personal information on this form is collected by the Toronto Public Libr
 ary under the Public Libraries Act\, sections 20(a)\, 20(c)\, and 20(d). T
 he information will only be used for event and program registration\, deli
 very and evaluation. Questions about how the library handles your informat
 ion can be directed to Answerline staff at\nanswerline@tpl.ca\n\, 416-397-
 5981\, 789 Yonge Street\, Toronto ON M4W 2G8.
LOCATION:Weston\, Children's Department
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6ac5447f96ec3a003ad8b0b3
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — School Age
END:VEVENT
