SUMMARY: Nightmare! Presented by Rogue Heels Co & Awkward Arts Co
DESCRIPTION:Welcome to NIGHTMARE!\n\nAn Immersive Theatrical Show Present
 ed by Rogue Heels Co & Awkward Arts Co!\n\nJoin us for a parody reimagini
 ng of your favourite cult classic Christmas/Halloween movie! It will be b
 rought to life right here in Toronto by an incredible cast of over 30 tal
 ented dancers\, actors\, and musicians!!!\n\nThis show will have somethin
 g for everyone! It features stunning heels dancers\, a soundtrack from a 
 vast array of musical genres\, live folk music\, festive burlesque\, punk
  rock\, theatrical storytelling & more!\n\nJoin Jaxx as she brings the jo
 y of Christmas to her Halloween community!\n\nTrust us\, you don't want t
 o miss this! Let us help you say farewell to Halloween and launch your ho
 liday season!!\n\nFollow us @rogueheelsco @awkwardartsco for more info ab
 out our show\, performers\, guests\, plus updates and a peek behind-the-s
 cenes!
