SUMMARY: Disney's The Little Mermaid — Act 2 Players
DESCRIPTION:Act 2 Players proudly presents Disney's The Little Mermaid - 
 the inaugural production of a new community theatre company! Join them un
 der the sea for this beloved family musical. PERFORMANCES:\n\n  * Thursda
 y\, November 19\, 2026 at 8:00 PM\;\n  * Friday\, November 20\, 2026 at 8
 :00 PM\;\n  * Saturday\, November 21\, 2026 at 2:00 PM (Relaxed Performan
 ce)\;\n  * Saturday\, November 21\, 2026 at 7:30 PM\;\n  * Sunday\, Novem
 ber 22\, 2026 at 2:00 PM (Relaxed Performance).\n\nTICKETS: $40 CAD flat\
 , General Admission. Buy tickets via the event website link above.\n\nGOO
 D TO KNOW: The weekend matinees are Relaxed Performances. The venue is fu
 lly accessible. Approximate runtime: 2.5 hours. All ages welcome.\n\nCONT
