SUMMARY:Saturday Night Dinner and Disco Party! (November 21st)
DESCRIPTION:Soul City Social Club (Toronto\, Canada)\nGood day everyone\,\
 n\nPlease join us for a great evening as we mix\, mingle\, make new friend
 s\, dinner party and dance the night away with a fabulous Live Disco Band!
 \n\n\\*Joined by my other social groups too\; so we can anticipate a fabul
 ous turn out with lots of friendly peers to enjoy dinner and the game\n\n*
 *\\*Meet us inside Smoke Show between 6:00 pm and 8:00 pm**\n\\*If you hav
 e to arrive after that\, still let the front door guy know you are with St
 eve's group so he can direct you to us (but kindly do your best to arrive 
 between 6:00 pm and 8:00 pm (as I can't promise seating after that)-Thank 
 you!\n\n(Event Details Below)\n\nSincerely\,\n\nSteve Flemming\n(Organizer
 /Host )\n\nEvent Details:\n**Saturday Night Dinner and Disco Party! (with 
 Live Band\, DJ and Dancing after)**\n\n-A fun\, interactive\, event with f
 riends\, food\, reserved seating\, Live Disco Band\, DJ and Dancing!\n-Sup
 er fun atmosphere at one of Toronto's most iconic Music venues\n-Pool Tabl
 e available\n-Plenty of parking all around the venue and very close to Mt.
  Pleasant Station\n\n**Event Fee:**\n10 dollars (cash only) when you arriv
 e (HST is included)\nor e transfer in advance to [Steveflemming11@gmail.co
 m](http://Steveflemming11@gmail.com/)\n(One Beverage or Appetizer Minimum 
 please)\n\n(1 minute walk from the new Mt. Pleasant & Eglinton station)
