DTEND:20261122T073000Z
URL:https://tockify.com/torevent/detail/25142/1795312800000
SUMMARY: WWOMB: Soft Tease
DESCRIPTION:WWOMB (Wonderful World of Make Believe) focuses on creating i
 mmersive\, artistically tuned-in spaces\, with a key focus on sacred femi
 nine expression.\n\nWelcoming a stellar lineup\, we're bringing in Montre
 al-based sound selectress\, JESKA\, for her Toronto headline debut\, alon
 gside local bass favourites\, Stella Maise & MMXXI. With a no-phones-on-t
 he-dance floor policy\, you'll be invited to freely move your body to an 
 amazing soundtrack all night long.\n\nThe WWOMB team is curating an in-ve
 nue decompression space\, as well as physical art installs that'll allow 
 you to melt into our vision.\n\nAdditionally\, we will be graced by the m
 agic of cross-the-walls projections created & worked LIVE by the talented
  Fongkikid and be swept away in femme energy with the Alice dance troupe 
 for a special midnight show.\n\nMusic genres to expect: drum & bass\, jun
 gle\, bass\, dubstep\, techno\, hard techno\, and more!\n\nThis event is 
 a soft launch/teaser for the 7-part WWOMB event series that will come to 
 life in the new year. Hop on the wave early\, and join us in blooming som
 ething beautiful.\n\nFollow us on Instagram for more on WWOMB and Sending
  Signals (@sendingsignals.ca mailto:(@sendingsignals.ca ).\n\n\n---\n\nPl
 ease read our full policies on our http://SendingSignals.ca website.\n\nW
 WOMB is a femme led space\, open to all. However\, if you are uncomfortab
 le with femininity being the primary cultural and aesthetic focus\, this 
 event is not for you.\n\nSafety and respect won’t be compromised. This ev
 ent is for celebrating women\, femme-presenting and gender-diverse indivi
 duals. This helps us create and preserve an atmosphere that makes our gat
 herings feel sacred and safe.\n\nArrive with openness\, joy\, a love for 
 music and desire for human connection. This is a shared experience\; plea
 se contribute to its magic.
CATEGORIES:DJ/Club/Rave,Studio-V
X-TKF-FEATURED-IMAGE:https://d3flpus5evl89n.cloudfront.net/6755f3e6a02aaf
 1c2599e757/6af3a72033339b9bfdf58fe2/scaled_1024.jpg
X-TKF-CUSTOM-PREVIEW:WWOMB (Wonderful World of Make Believe) focuses on c
 reating immersive\, artistically tuned-in spaces\, with a key focus on sa
 cred feminine expression....
