DESCRIPTION:Thank Goodness It's Sunday :) | 4AM LAST CALL\n\nPut on your 
 Sunday best\, sip your tips\, or ride that bender. Join us for a late che
 ck-out and reset your week at Wiggle Room at the Industry Weekly Social.\
 n\n\nEvery Sunday funday\, at your SerVice!\nwith Toronto's finest: MANZO
 NE & STRONG https://on.soundcloud.com/yjJCoMeTijpVkmAEA and the Wiggly fa
 mily.\nCOMPLIMENTARY Entry before 10pm with RSVP\nOpen at 8pm ~ 4AM LAST 
