UID:tribe-10103050@scaddingcourt.org
DESCRIPTION:Family Math is a six day program that is community based and d
 esigned to help and involve families in their children’s math education.
  The sessions educates parents/caregivers how to work and play using the c
 oncepts that are learned in this program. The aim is to encourage children
 \, parents and caregivers to develop positive attitudes towards mathematic
