SUMMARY:Drop-In Co-op Support (Virtual)
DTSTART:20261123T160000Z
DTEND:20261123T170000Z
DTSTAMP:20261030T222200Z
UID:MEC-9981ae50de43432c6299c5a4c5d30050@events.yorku.ca__20261123
SEQUENCE:2
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://events.yorku.ca/wp-content/uploads/2026/
 10/HANDBOOKCOVERSHOOT-218-small.jpg
CATEGORIES:Co-op &amp\; Career Centre,Co-op Drop-in (CCC),Information Sess
 ions (CCC)
CLASS:PUBLIC
CREATED:20261030
DESCRIPTION:Want to connect with a Co-op Coordinator? Join a Co-op Drop-in
 ! It’s the easiest & fastest way to get your questions answered.\nSessio
 n Format: This session is conducted in a group format in order to reduce 
 wait times and to facilitate collaborative and group learning. Breakout ro
 oms are available where students can meet with Co-op Coordinators privatel
 y to discuss specific circumstances. Typically there is a queue for these 
 and we encourage students to join the drop-in time early. To ensure we pro
 vide support to as many students as possible these meetings are from 5-10 
 minutes in duration.\nJoin via Zoom using your PPY York U Log-in account:
  https://yorku.zoom.us/my/askcoop\nHaving trouble logging in? Please mak
 e sure you’re using your PPY York U login. When you select SSO (Single S
 ign-On)\, you should be prompted to sign in with your PPY credentials. If 
 you use a different login\, you may not be able to access the system.\n
LAST-MODIFIED:20261030
PRIORITY:5
TRANSP:OPAQUE
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/drop-in-co-op-support-virtual-7/
X-SOURCE:York University
END:VEVENT
