SUMMARY:Level Up | Work Smarter: Using AI to advance your career
DTSTART:20261123T170000Z
DTEND:20261123T180000Z
DTSTAMP:20261028T191700Z
UID:MEC-dacb8cf07e5031179a2da26abd616327@events.yorku.ca
RECURRENCE-ID:20261123T170000Z
SEQUENCE:4
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://events.yorku.ca/wp-content/uploads/2024/1
 0/levelupoct8_ebanner_1200.png
CATEGORIES:Advancement/Alumni,Co-op &amp\; Career Centre
CLASS:PUBLIC
CREATED:20261028
DESCRIPTION:AI is changing the workplace. Are you ready for it?\nJoin our 
 upcoming webinar to explore practical tools\, real-world applications\, an
 d best practices for using AI with confidence. Featuring guest speaker\, A
 reebah Hassan (MMAI ’25)\, Manager\, AI Strategy and Governance\, CIBC 
 \nThis session will dive into the following questions:\n\nWhat can AI actu
 ally do for my career?\nWhich AI tools should I know about?\nHow can I eff
 ectively use AI without compromising my skills\, judgment or professional 
 reputation?\n\nDate: Monday\, Nov. 23\nTime: 12 p.m. ET\nFormat: Zoom webi
 nar\n
LAST-MODIFIED:20261111
ORGANIZER;CN="Office of Alumni Engagement":MAILTO:alumni@yorku.ca
