CREATED:20261019
DESCRIPTION:What would your wallet say if it could talk?  \nCelebrate Fi
 nancial Literacy Month with a fun and interactive activity that gets stude
 nts talking about money. Spin the wheel\, answer a money-themed prompt\, a
 nd explore topics like spending\, saving\, borrowing\, budgeting\, and fin
 ancial planning. Share your perspective\, learn from everyday financial sc
 enarios\, discover York resources that support financial success\, and win
  a prize along the way. \n
