DESCRIPTION:Learn about photo emulsion screen printing and make your own s
 creen print creations to take home!\nThis workshop is all about creativit
 y\, experimentation\, self-expression\, and upcycling. Teens will create
  their own silkscreen\, expose a hand-drawn design of their choice\, and 
 print it onto a tote bag\, fabric\, and paper. All materials will be provi
 ded\, however participants are welcome to bring extra textile or paper it
 ems to print their design on.
