SUMMARY:Tuesday Night Book Club
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261124T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261124T200000
UID:6ae4b97ead402765915592bd@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Welcome to Wychwood's Tuesday Night Book Club where we discuss
  award winning\, thought provoking works of literature.\nFor November we a
 re reading\nChain Gang All-Stars\nby Nana Kwame Adjei-Brenyah. Copies are
  available for pick up at the first floor desk.\nNo registration required\
 , drop in.
