X-SOURCE-ID:events
SUMMARY:VCP presents LADY AUDLEY’S SECRET
DTSTART:20261126T130000Z
DTEND:20261129T230000Z
DTSTAMP:20261013T190700Z
UID:MEC-c73edcecd97f8e999b5cd937d5e6827e@events.yorku.ca
RECURRENCE-ID:20261126T130000Z
SEQUENCE:2
CATEGORIES:LA&amp\;PS Colleges,LA&amp\;PS Open to the Public,LA&amp\;PS St
 udent Success,LA&amp\;PS Students All,LA&amp\;PS Vanier College Production
 s
CLASS:PUBLIC
CREATED:20261013
DESCRIPTION:An Original Version of Miss Braddon’s popular Novel\,\nIn Tw
 o Acts\nBy C. H. Hazelwood\nAdapted from the 1862 novel of the same name\,
  Lady Audley’s Secret is a classic example of Victorian melodrama. Conce
 rning the ambitious\, unscrupulous Lady Audley who\, in order to preserve 
 her present situation is prepared\, when an unwanted husband returns\, to 
 attempt to get rid of him in the garden well. But she is observed – and 
 struggle and twist as she may\, neither bribery nor attempted arson avail 
 her. Nemesis overtakes her and tragedy ensues.\nFind out what she is hidin
 g and the lengths to which she will go to in order to protect Lady Audley
 ’s Secret.\nDirected by Jean-Paul Yovanoff\nStage Managed by Nicole Liso
 v\nNov. 26 – Nov. 29\, 2026\nThur-Sat @ 7:30pm\nSun @ 2:30pm\nFred Thury
  Studio Theatre\, 258 Vanier College\nTo reach the theatre\, take the stai
 rs or elevator on the east side of Vanier College to the second floor.\nPa
 y-What-You-Can-Afford Tickets\nSuggested Pricing: VCP Supporter $50 | Gene
 ral $25 | VCP Alumni $20 | Students $15 | VCP Current Company $10\nAvailab
 le online or CASH ONLY at door\nWebsite: Lady Audley’s Secret | Vanier C
 ollege Productions ( https://www.yorku.ca/laps/vcp/current-season/lady-aud
 leys-secret/ )\nEmail: vcp@yorku.ca ( mailto:vcp@yorku.ca )\nFacebook: @Va
 nierCollegeProductions\nInstagram: @vancproductions\n
LAST-MODIFIED:20261105
LOCATION:Fred Thury Studio Theatre\, 258 Vanier College
PRIORITY:5
TRANSP:OPAQUE
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/vcp-presents-lady-audleys-secret/
X-SOURCE:York University
END:VEVENT
