DESCRIPTION:Dive into the art of Arabic calligraphy in this 60-minute work
 shop. Learn the history and basics of Arabic script\, including how to hol
 d the pen\, scaling\, and beginner exercises to build precision. Explore C
 reative Dimensions like letter variations\, stroke adjustments\, and integ
 ration through live demonstrations. Perfect for beginners\, this session b
 lends tradition with creativity\, giving you the skills to create your own
  calligraphic art.\nRegistration required. Register on tpl.ca\, in-branch 
 or by calling 416-393-7650.\nInformation Collection Notice:\nThe personal 
 information on this form is collected by the Toronto Public Library under 
