DESCRIPTION:Build on your basic Microsoft Word 2019 skills and learn to us
 e Word more effectively.\nIn this class\, you will:\n- Practice new Word s
 kills while you design a flyer\n- Format text\, margins\, indents\, header
 s and footers\n- Format text as columns\n- Create bulleted\, numbered and 
 sorted lists\n- Review your document with Spelling and Grammar check and T
 hesaurus\nUpon completion of this class students will be able to use even 
 more Word tools to design their documents.\nPre-requisite:  Word Basics 1 
 or equivalent skills. Basic keyboarding and mouse skills required.\nFormat
 : Hands-on with demonstrations\n[90 min]
