DESCRIPTION:Drop-in on the last Thursday of the month for a lively book di
 scussion led by a librarian!\nRegular Print copies of November's selection
 \,\nThe Lion Women of Tehran\nby Marjan Kamali\, are now available for pic
 k up from the first floor reference desk.\nThis title is also available in
  Large Print\, as an eBook\, and as an Audiobook on CD.\nUpcoming Titles:
 \nSeptember 24 - All's Well by Mona Awad\nOctober 29 - Prairie Edge by Co
 nor Kerr\nNovember 26 - The Lion Women of Tehran by Marjan Kamali\nJanuary
  28 - To Be Announced\nFebruary 25 - Encampment by Maggie Helwig\nMarch 25
  - The Tainted Cup by Robert Jackson Bennett
LOCATION:North York Central Library\, Room 2/3\, 2nd Floor
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/69f603ae596674bcd583e839
