DESCRIPTION:Address:\nSay Hey House\nToronto\, ON\nCanada\n\nSeeds of Chan
 ge is a story about the strength of an idea. It is a mini-documentary expl
 oring the shift from when someone takes a step from climate awareness into
  action. Come along as we follow the journeys of five people\, from the mo
 ment something sparked their interest in environmental action to where the
 y are now and their hopes for the future. Seeds of Change represents a div
 ersity of voices of everyday people who joined something\, showed up\, and
  made a change.\nJoin us for our very first screening of the film! Doors o
 pen at 6:30 PM\, and the screening will start at 7:00 PM.\nSeeds of Change
 …\n\nHosted by envisionearth
