DESCRIPTION:November is Make a Will Month and TPL is delighted to host the
  Ontario Bar Association. Learn about the importance of having a will and 
 powers of attorney for you and your family. A member of the\nOntario Bar A
 ssociation\nwho practices Trusts and Estates Law will speak about:\nthe el
 ements of a will and what happens if you don’t have one\,\nwhat are powe
 rs of attorney and why they are important\,\nspecial considerations to kee
 p in mind when preparing your estate and care plans.\nNote\, this program 
 is for general information only\, not for drafting individual wills.\nRegi
 stration required\n. Drop-ins welcome.
