SUMMARY: Tote Bag Painting & Social Gathering | Tea Time Circle
DESCRIPTION:Looking to meet new people\, make new friends\, and enjoy a c
 reative morning in Toronto? 🎨\n\nJoin Tea Time Circle for our first Pain
 ting Gathering! A relaxed and welcoming space where women can connect\, s
 ocialize\, and have fun while painting their own tote bags.\n\nCome solo 
 or bring a friend! No painting experience is needed. Simply pick your des
 ign\, choose your colors\, and create something unique while meeting new 
 people.\n\nEvent Details:\n\n📅 Saturday\, November 28\, 2026\n🕚 11:00 A
 M – 1:00 PM\n📍 Daniels Spectrum\, 585 Dundas St E\, Toronto (2nd Floor)\
 n🎟️ $10 per person (cost-recovery fee)\n\nYour participation fee include
 s all painting materials\, a tote bag\, and a hot drink.\n\nWhether you'r
 e new to Toronto\, looking to expand your social circle\, or simply want 
 to try something creative\, we'd love to have you join us!\n\nSpaces are 
 limited. Send us a DM on Instagram @ http://tea.time.circle to reserve yo
 ur spot.\n\nCome ready to create\, have fun\, and meet someone new! ♡
