SUMMARY: Beginner linocut printmaking workshop
DESCRIPTION:In this workshop\, we will focus on the fundamentals of linol
 eum block printing\, from how to think about your design and transfer it 
 to the linoleum block\, to carving the block and creating a stamp\, inkin
 g\, and finally printing it. You'll go home with 2 postcards with your de
 sign printed on them\, as well as your carved linoleum block\, which you 
 can use over and over on paper or fabric. All materials are supplied.
CATEGORIES:Workshop,Centre-for-Social-Innovation
