 mpressions and original characters to life in this holiday comedy spectac
 ular. Get into the spirit with Ina's iconic Christmas Cosmopolitan\, rece
 ive gift-giving advice from Martha Stewart\, see improvised holiday movie
  magic with James Corden\, and enjoy original sketches\, musical numbers 
 and lots more guaranteed to make the yuletide gay.\n\nTom Hearn (@isthatt
 omhearn) is a comedian and actor splitting his time between New York City
  and Toronto. Named a 2025 Just For Laughs New Face of Comedy\, he has bu
 ilt a following of over 700K and more than 150 million views online. His 
