DESCRIPTION:Join other book lovers in your community and participate in li
 vely discussions of popular books. This book club will meet every First Tu
 esday of the month for a lively discussion in a welcoming\, relaxed settin
 g. New members are always welcome and encouraged to join.\nDecember 1\, 20
 26\n-\nOn the Ravine by Vincent Lam\nJ\nanuary 5\, 2027 - The Day I left Y
 ou- Caroline Bishop\nFebruary 2\, 2027 - A Great Country - Shilpi Somaya G
 owda\nMarch 2\, 2027 - The Personal Librarian - Marie Benedict\nCopies of 
 the book are available for borrowing at the Port Union Library.\nDrop-in\
 , no registration necessary.
LOCATION:Port Union\, Meeting Room
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6a839956386764026a175164
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Older Adults
