SUMMARY:Retirement Planning and Living
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261201T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261201T150000
UID:6aed106c3c35b95bcb2a0846@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:It's never too late to start thinking about investing! Managin
 g your finances to maximize your retirement years is the goal of retiremen
 t planning. Your retirement strategy should strike a balance between your 
 financial realities\, requirements and wants. This presentation will cover
  how to plan for retirement\, sources of retirement income and how to prot
 ect yourself from scams\, frauds and financial abuse.\nPresented by\nCanad
 ian Investment Regulatory Organization (CIRO)\n\, a national self-regulato
 ry organization that oversees all investment dealers\, mutual fund dealers
  and trading activity on Canada’s debt and equity marketplaces.\nhttps:/
 /www.ciro.ca/about-ciro\nThis is a drop-in program. No registration requir
 ed.
LOCATION:Maria A. Shchuka\, Children's Program Room - Main Floor
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6aed106c3c35b95bcb2a0846
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Older Adults
END:VEVENT
