 d\, specifically examining how rap music utilizes poetic tools like rhyth
 m\, metaphor\, and storytelling. The goal is to help participants recogni
 ze rap as poetry in motion\, analyze lyrics analytically\, and create ori
 ginal spoken word pieces inspired by musical flow and technique\nThis pro
 gram is part of Youth Hub service. Youth Hubs are a welcoming place for te
