DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261202T190000
UID:6aea30773c35b95bcb296f96@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Develop and exercise the skills you need to be an active parti
 cipant in everyday democracy in this fun\, interactive\n6\n0-minute\nsessi
 on.\nDemocracy Fitness expands traditional ideas of what democracy is by e
 xploring the skills that help people participate in civic life\, build con
 nection\, and work better together.\nIn this session\, we’ll exercise ou
 r\nCompromise Muscle:\nIn a democracy\, we find solutions together. When 
 we make room for each other’s approaches\, more people can accept the de
 cisions.\nRegistration Recommended. Drop-ins welcome.\nAdults only.\nThis 
 program is offered in partnership with Democracy Fitness Global and MASS L
 BP.\nGenerously supported by McConnell Foundation.\nInformation Collection
  Notice:\nThe personal information on this form is collected by the Toront
 o Public Library under the Public Libraries Act\, sections 20(a)\, 20(c)\,
  and 20(d). The information will only be used for event and program regist
 ration\, delivery and evaluation. Questions about how the library handles 
 your information can be directed to Answerline staff at\nanswerline@tpl.ca
 \n\, 416-397-5981\, 789 Yonge Street\, Toronto ON M4W 2G8.
LOCATION:Richview
