 ew people in a sophisticated and relaxed atmosphere.\n\nYour ticket includ
 es a **FREE DRINK** to enjoy as you mingle and make connections at **The P
 owder Room**\, an upscale cocktail lounge at 129 Yorkville Ave. **Please a
 rrive before 9pm to receive your free drink ticket.**\n\nBest of all\, you
  can use our exclusive Meet & Click web application to Like or Pass on peo
 ple as you meet them. They will do the same for you\, and if the feeling i
 s mutual we will let you know the next day!
