UID:6adbbfc8035faf0033de9674@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Explore mindfulness practices that support emotional well-bein
 g\, focus\, and self-awareness while experimenting with art-based exercise
 s that encourage reflection and stress reduction. No prior experience with
  mindfulness or art is required. Drop in. No registration required.\nThis 
 workshop is part of the Teen Social Health and Wellness programming. Gener
 ously supported by The Estate of Claudia Krawchuk.\nThis program is part o
 f Youth Hub service. Youth Hubs are a welcoming place for teens after scho
 ol and in the summer\, where helpful staff are always available. Free\, n
 utritious snacks are offered daily. Drop by a branch with a\nYouth Hub\no
 r call the branch to find out more.\nThe Mount Dennis Youth Hub is for you
 th that are 13-17 years old in grades 8-12.
