DESCRIPTION:This interactive workshop\, presented by HAGO (Help A Girl Out
  ( https://helpagirlout.org/ ))\, combines menstrual health education with
  menstrual equity advocacy. Through a presentation\, group discussions and
  scenario-based activities\, participants will:\n\nBuild their understandi
 ng of periods and menstrual health\nLearn about the work of inspiring chan
 gemakers\nExplore real-world barriers to menstrual equity\nDiscover meanin
 gful ways to advocate for menstrual equity and create change in their comm
 unities\n\nParticipants will also have the chance to pick up a free pair o
 f Knix period underwear and/or a Diva Cup.\nDate: Thursday\, December 3\nT
 ime: 12:30 – 1:30PM\nLocation: Victor Phillip Dahdaleh Building\, Room 1
 017\nDrop-ins are welcome\, registration just helps us get a sense of how 
 many people to expect so we can plan ahead.\nRegister for Flow Into Action
 \n
