DESCRIPTION:\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nThis session w
 ill highlight the $10\,000 York Science Scholars Award (YSSA)\, the $10\,0
 00 Helen Freedhoff First-Year Award for Physics applicants\, and the $25\,
 000 Yavin Family International Science Student Scholarship for internation
 al applicants.\nThe YSSA and Helen Freedhoff award consists of a $5\,000 e
 ntrance scholarship and a guaranteed $5\,000 paid summer research position
