DESCRIPTION:Peer-Assisted Study Session (PASS) Leader: Prachi\nThis Peer-a
 ssisted Study Session (PASS) is for : MATH 1025: Applied Linear Algebra\nP
 articipate in weekly\, collaborative study sessions led by a peer who has 
 successfully completed the course. Review key concepts\, ask questions and
  discover effective strategies to boost your confidence and academic succe
 ss.\nPlease Note: Any schedule changes or session cancellations will be co
 mmunicated through eClass. Students are encouraged to check eClass regular
 ly for the most up-to-date information. During Fall Reading Week\, Peer-As
 sisted Study Sessions\, Tutoring\, and Office Hours are typically not offe
 red. If a session is scheduled during this period\, details will be commun
 icated by the course instructor and posted in eClass.\nLearn more about PA
 SS ( https://students.yorku.ca/PASS ).\n
LAST-MODIFIED:20261112
LOCATION:MK 2040\, Markham Campus
ORGANIZER;CN="Markham Campus Peer-Assisted Study Sessions":MAILTO:
