DESCRIPTION:Get into the holiday spirit with a screening of\nWhile You We
 re Sleeping\n(1995)\nfeaturing Sandra Bullock and Bill Pullman.\nLucy sav
 es a handsome stranger\, Peter\, from certain death\, but he is left in a 
 coma. His family mistakenly believes that Lucy is Peter's fiancée\, and s
 he can't bear to tell the truth. Lucy then begins to fall in love with Pet
 er's brother.\nRuntime:1h 43m
LOCATION:Pape/Danforth\, 2nd floor\, program room.
