DESCRIPTION:Hello Ice Skaters\, Welcome everyone. This is the first Friday
  evening skating of 2026/2027 season. Hopefully the weather will co-operat
 e and it will be cold enough to skate outside. We plan to skate at College
  Park Trail and go out for dinner after at a restaurant near by. Please Re
 gister for Ice Skating. We are skating on public rinks and there are no fe
 es required for guests. If you cannot attend\, please remember to cancel. 
 By TTC - Take the subway to College Park station. College Park trail is in
  the center of the block between College St. & Gerrard St. W and Yonge St.
  & Bay St. There is a shelter to warm up in and put your skates on. There 
 is also a washroom. We skate for about an hour a...
