DESCRIPTION:Fri Dec 4: Marc DePulse [Germany]\nTyler Hill | Anthony Cole 
 | CRISTI:ANA\n\n\nHailing from Leipzig\, Germany\, Marc DePulse is an int
 ernationally respected DJ and producer known for his signature blend of m
 elodic house\, indie dance and driving underground grooves. He's been roc
 king it for over 25 years in electronic music with hundreds of releases o
 n respected labels including Diynamic\, Einmusika and Katermukke\, and no
 w Wiggle Room Records.\n\n\nAdvance Tickets: https://wiggleroomtoronto.co
 m/event/wr-records-marc-depulse-ger-tyler-hill-release-party/\nEarly Wigg
 ler: $20\nThe Wiggler: $25\n\n https://www.beatport.com/release/i-dont-de
 pend-on-you/7092756\nPerformances: https://www.beatport.com/label/wiggle-
 room-records/109275\n10-11:30 Anthony Cole\n11:30-1 Tyler Hill\n1-3:30 MA
 RC DEPULSE\n3:30-close CRISTI:ANA\nVJ Amir Nian\n\n#WiggleRoomToronto is 
 the #HomeofBouncyBeats\nOptions for prepaid table/ticket packages (ONE ti
 cket = everything mentioned):\n\n1) The 3rd Wheel: $363\nincludes: 3 Gene
 ral Admissions\; 1 Bottle of Stoli Vodka\n\n2) Regular Package: $700\ninc
 ludes: 6 General Admissions\; 2 Regular Bottles of Choice (may email wigg
 lyevents@gmail.com mailto:wigglyevents@gmail.com to specify choice)\n\n3)
  Premium Package: $900\nincludes: 6 General Admissions\; 2 Premium Bottle
