SUMMARY: Late Night Hype
DESCRIPTION:Fridays don't end at midnight\, they start at 11:30. This is 
 the Late-Night Hype.\n\nFeaturing comics seen on Just For Laughs\, Yuk Yu
 k's\, festivals\, clubs\, and stages across Canada\, Late-Night Hype deli
 vers a mix of big laughs\, and the kind of unpredictable moments that onl
 y happen late at night.\n\nKick off your weekend with some of the funnies
 t comedians Toronto has to offer.\n\nShow starts at 11:30pm. Tickets are 
 $25 online or at the door.\n\n\nTickets can be pre-purchased here:\n\ncom
 edybar.ca/shows/late-night-hype https://comedybar.ca/shows/late-night-hyp
 e\n\nShow runtime is approx. 1h15min
