DESCRIPTION:One of China’s leading players of Yangqin (dulcimer/cimbalom
 /Santoor)\, Pingxin Xu will present this powerful instrument with a variet
 y of music. Besides\, his students will also present other Chinese instrum
 ents such as Guzheng\, Pipa\, etc\, it will be a feast to the ear. Open t
 o all ages.
LOCATION:Albert Campbell\, Auditorium (lower level)
