SUMMARY: Toronto Made Holiday Market
DESCRIPTION:Get ready to shop\, celebrate and love local—the Toronto Made
  Holiday Market is returning to Daniels Spectrum!\n\nJoin us Saturday\, D
 ecember 5th\, 11am-7pm for a festive day bringing together 75+ local make
 rs and small businesses.\n\n\nWith unique gifts\, talented creators\, fre
 e Santa photos and free admission\, this is a holiday outing to put at th
 e top of your calendar. From thoughtful handmade treasures to stocking st
 uffers and unexpected finds\, discover your new favourite local business 
 and check names off your holiday shopping list—all while supporting the c
 reativity and entrepreneurial spirit of our city.\n\nCome ready to discov
 er\, connect and celebrate the season with your community.\n\n\nSaturday\
 , December 5\, 2026 | 11 a.m.–7 p.m.\nDaniels Spectrum | 585 Dundas Stree
 t East\, Toronto\nFree admission | Free Santa photos\, 2–5 p.m.\n\nOn-sit
 e parking\, coat check and an accessible entrance are available.\n\n\nMak
 e it a festive day out! Gather your friends\, bring the family and explor
 e a lively indoor marketplace filled with opportunities to find something
  special.
