SUMMARY: Meet New People\, 50+ Board Games & After Dark Specials | Ages 25
 –45
DESCRIPTION:Toronto 20's to 50's Singles Social (4000+)\nDecember is here\
 , and it's a lovely time to get out\, meet some new faces and make room fo
 r a few new connections before the year comes to an end. ❤️\n\nJoin us
  for a professionally hosted social evening where you don't have to worry 
 about who to approach or how to get conversations started. Our host guides
  you through short conversations\, rotations and interactive connection ro
 unds\, making it easy to meet different people and discover common interes
 ts in a relaxed\, welcoming setting.\n\nWe're back at Stout Irish Pub in C
 abbagetown — a relaxed Irish pub with food\, drinks and 50+ board games\
 , giving you plenty of ways to keep socialising after the hosted rounds.\n
 \n🎟️ Book Early & Save: [https://toronto5thdec.eventbrite.co.uk](http
 s://toronto5thdec.eventbrite.co.uk)\nEarly Bird: CAD $10\nRegular: CAD $15
 \nAt the Door: CAD $20 cash — payable to the host.\nBooking ahead helps 
 us plan the right group size and venue space\, and your ticket confirms yo
 ur place.\n\n🤝 What to Expect\n7:00 PM — Welcome & Drinks\nMeet your 
 host\, Faye\, grab a drink and settle in.\nComing alone? You're in good co
 mpany! Many guests attend solo\, and we'll help you feel comfortable and g
 et connected from the start.\n7:30 PM — Fast Friends\nTime to meet some 
 new people!\nYou'll take part in a series of short\, guided conversations\
 , with rotations that give you the opportunity to meet different people th
 roughout the evening. Our host keeps everything flowing\, so you can simpl
 y relax and enjoy meeting others.\n✨ Themed Connection Rounds\nWe'll als
 o bring in interactive themed rounds and conversation prompts covering int
 erests\, experiences\, travel\, hobbies and more.\nThey're designed to hel
 p you move beyond introductions\, find unexpected common ground and get co
 nversations flowing naturally.\n🎲 8:30 PM onwards — Board Games & Soc
 ialising\nThe hosted rounds may finish\, but the evening doesn't have to!\
 nStout has 50+ board games available. Choose a game with the people you've
  met\, join a group\, grab another drink or simply continue chatting.\nYou
  don't need to be a board game enthusiast — they're just another fun way
  to break the ice and spend more time together.\n\n🍻 Staying Later?\nMa
 ke the most of Stout's After Dark Special\, running from 9–11 PM\, with 
 $7 beers and $7 highballs\, among other specials.\n\n❤️ Why Come Along
 ?\n✔️ Meet 15–25 new people in one evening\n✔️ Professionally ho
 sted conversations that make introductions easier\n✔️ Rotations so you
  get to meet a variety of people\n✔️ Interactive themed rounds to disc
 over shared interests\n✔️ 50+ board games to enjoy afterwards 🎲\n
 ✔️ Relaxed Irish pub atmosphere with food and drinks\n✔️ Reserved 
 space for our group\n✔️ Solo attendees welcome\n✔️ Plenty of time 
 to continue socialising after the hosted rounds\n✔️ Friendship-focused
  — not a dating event\n\n👋 Who Is It For?\nWhether you've recently mo
 ved to Toronto\, have been living here for years\, or simply want to bring
  some fresh faces into your social circle\, you're welcome!\nYou don't nee
 d to know anyone beforehand or arrive with a group. Come solo\, bring a fr
 iend or simply come ready to meet people and enjoy the evening.\n\n🌍 Ab
 out Fast Friends\nFor over 10 years\, Fast Friends has been bringing peopl
 e together through professionally hosted social events in 30+ cities world
 wide.\nOur goal is simple: make meeting new people easier\, more relaxed a
 nd more enjoyable.\nCome for the conversations. Stay for the games. Leave 
 with new connections. ❤️\nCome solo. We'll guide the experience. You m
 ake the connections. 🤝
