DESCRIPTION:Sat Dec 5: ESSEL [UK]\n3DAH! | SHERA | MIZ MEGS | Melanie Sut
 herland\n\nAdvance Tickets: https://wiggleroomtoronto.com/event/rise-esse
 l-toolroom/\nEarly Wiggler: $25\nThe Wiggler: $30\n\n\nRISE - proper hous
 e music with DJs who know how to move a room.\nBuilt with intention — cre
 ating space\, shifting balance\, and pushing the culture forward without 
 making a spectacle of it.\nWiggle Room is a Safer Dance Space\, where res
 pect on the floor matters as much as what comes through the speakers.\nCo
 me for the music. Stay for the energy.\n~ RISE ~\n\n\nStraight from the U
 K and signed to the iconic Toolroom Records\, ESSEL brings her signature 
 sound and dancefloor energy to Toronto. Get ready for a proper night of b
 ouncy house music!\n\nAdvance Tickets:\nEarly Wiggler: $25\nThe Wiggler: 
