DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261207T130000
UID:6ada7bd8a85a2c0033816e15@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Learn how to take control of your finances and make your money
  work for you. This practical workshop facilitated by a Financial empowerm
 ent staff member from North York Community House will help you understand 
 your income and expenses\, create a realistic budget\, start saving and le
 arn how to access government benefits you may be eligible for\, helping yo
 u build a stronger and more secure financial foundation.\nOne-on-one suppo
 rt is available at select branches. Meet with Financial Empowerment staff 
 for free financial counselling. Book your free appointment today. Speak wi
 th branch staff or visit\ntpl.ca/financial-empowerment\nfor more informati
 on.
LOCATION:Thorncliffe
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6ada7bd8a85a2c0033816e15
