DESCRIPTION:Toronto is one of the most multicultural cities where many di
 verse cultures and communities live. In this workshop\, we will explore ou
 r diverse restaurants\, bakeries\, and storefronts through illustration. W
 e will learn about composition and cropping\, how to apply watercolour was
 h and pen to create an illustration of your favourite Toronto shop.\nRegis
 tration required. Program is limited to 20 participants.
