SUMMARY:Instructional Skills Workshop (ISW) (IN-PERSON) – December 9\, 1
 0\, 11\, 2026
DTSTART:20261209T140000Z
DTEND:20261211T213000Z
DTSTAMP:20260630T183600Z
UID:MEC-457c753860099e09373e202e39292de9@events.yorku.ca
RECURRENCE-ID:20261209T140000Z
SEQUENCE:2
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://events.yorku.ca/wp-content/uploads/2026/0
 6/isw-logo-doodleBanner-large.png
CATEGORIES:Teaching &amp\; Learning
CLASS:PUBLIC
CREATED:20260630
DESCRIPTION:This 3-day intensive workshop encourages examination of one’
 s teaching practices with feedback focused on the learning process rather 
 than on the specific lesson content. The ISW engenders participatory learn
 ing and community building that can transfer back into the classroom. Part
 icipants work collaboratively in a small group setting of 4-5 participants
  to further develop their teaching effectiveness as they design and lead t
 hree 10-minute lessons. Following each\, participants receive reflective v
 erbal\, written\, and video feedback from the other participants who have 
 been learners.\nThis certificate is open to all faculty members (research 
 stream\, teaching stream\, contract).\nThis certificate is also available 
 for graduate students with at least 3 years of teaching experience. Altern
 atively\, graduate students are invited to complete the Teaching Assistant
  Certificate in Teaching (TACT) ( https://www.yorku.ca/teachingcommons/cer
 tificates/#tact ).\nThis is a three-day workshop series scheduled for Wedn
 esday December 9\, Thursday December 10\, and Friday December 11. Each day
  will run from 9 am to 4:30 pm in DB 1014.\n** Please kindly note: this is
  a 3-day workshop series intended for participants to attend  the entire w
 orkshop (all three days from 9am-4:30pm) in-person.\nRegister using our re
 gistration form ( https://teachingcommonsforms.apps01.yorku.ca/forms/view.
 php?id=1163054 ).\n
LAST-MODIFIED:20260630
LOCATION:DB 1014 Victor Philip Dahdaleh Bldg.
ORGANIZER;CN="Teaching Commons":MAILTO:teaching@yorku.ca
PRIORITY:5
TRANSP:OPAQUE
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/instructional-skills-workshop-isw-in-pe
 rson-december-9-10-11-2026/
X-SOURCE:York University
END:VEVENT
