UID:6ae11a349dbc2b002c9177f3@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Wellness Unplugged: Move\, Breathe & Recharge\nExplore how yog
 a\, Pilates and mindful breathing can help manage stress\, improve mood an
 d support your well-being. The Villij leads this interactive workshop on t
 he history and benefits of these practices through discussions\, journalin
 g and hands-on activities. Learn simple techniques you can use in your dai
 ly life. No experience or equipment needed.\nOpen to all teens.\nRegistrat
 ion encouraged - Drop-ins welcome.
