 ays are all about! Wednesday December 9th 8pm. Comedy Bar\, 945 Bloor Str
 eet west. Tickets $25 advance / $30 at the door. Come join the funny for 
 what has become a Terrific Toronto Queer Christmas Comedy Tradition! (try
  saying that fast three times!) ACCESSIBILTY Comedy Bar Bloor is a baseme
 nt venue with 16 steps down to the entrance. Washrooms are located on the
  main floor.
