DESCRIPTION:Do you have a stock of beautiful cards\, paper keepsakes and e
 nvelopes in your home? Learn how to turn them into a No-Sew Book during th
 is 2-hour workshop with Sandra Reford! This workshop uses upcycled paper\,
  postcards\, envelopes\, and other paper materials. The accordion-style co
 nstruction will allow pages to be added as needed. Participants will learn
  how to construct the book\, variations on construction\, closure options\
 , hinging pages and making ephemera.\nRegistration is required.
