  your writing. Following the Pomodoro Technique\, this weekly session is y
 our time to work on a thesis\, dissertation\, article\, or other academic 
 projects.\nRepeating weekly from October 2 – December 18\, 2026.\nRegist
 ration is required: Register Now\nShould you have any questions\, please e
 mail Marco at msestito@yorku.ca ( mailto:msestito@yorku.ca ).\n
