SUMMARY: Dom We Now Our Gay Apparel
DESCRIPTION:Dominick Pupa\, nightclub sensation and cohost of the hit pod
 cast FixingFamousPeople\, returns to Toronto with Dom We Now Our Gay Appa
 rel. TimeOutNY calls his acclaimed annual skewering of the year that was\
 , “One of the 50 Best Things to do at Christmas.” It’s a pop culture roas
 ting with holiday music parodies that will ruin the Christmas classics fo
 r you forever. Jokes\, songs\, one elf\, no shelf.
