SUMMARY:Toronto Singles Improv Night (Late show)
DESCRIPTION:20s 30s Toronto Social & Activities\nNOTE: **This is a tickete
 d event. Please purchase a ticket to attend.**\n\n**Tickets here:** [https
 ://comedybar.ca/shows/toronto-singles-improv-night](https://comedybar.ca/s
 hows/toronto-singles-improv-night)\n\nAre you ready to get a little naught
 y? Leave your halo at home and join us for Toronto Singles Improv Night (S
 IN) — a late-night comedy experience where the jokes are dirty\, the hum
 our is outrageous\, and absolutely anything can happen!\n\nFeaturing a tal
 ented cast of professional improvisers and comedy actors with experience f
 rom The Second City Toronto and Bad Dog Theatre\, this is not your typical
  night at the comedy club.\n\nExpect hilarious\, unpredictable and sometim
 es downright sinful improv inspired by YOUR suggestions\, confessions\, fa
 ntasies and questionable decisions. You'll have opportunities to participa
 te\, throw out ideas\, influence the scenes and maybe even become part of 
 the show!\n\nWhether you're single\, mischievous\, adventurous or just loo
 king for a night that's a little different\, this is your chance to laugh\
 , flirt\, meet new people and let your naughty side out to play.\n\n**Sche
 dule of events:**\n\n**10:00 PM:** Mix & Mingle – Casually hang out and 
 meet other singles\, grab a drink and break the ice.\n\n**11:00 PM:** The 
 SIN Show – Let the outrageous improv begin!\n\n**A FRIENDLY WARNING:** T
 his is a late night show which may get raunchy\, risqué and unapologetica
 lly naughty. Expect adult humour\, unexpected twists and plenty of sinful 
 surprises. Viewer discretion is advised!\n\nCome for the laughs\, stay for
  the chemistry\, and possibly leave with that special someone?
