SUMMARY: Nervous Records: MIKE NERVOUS & MANDIZ [Extended Set]
DESCRIPTION:Sat Dec 12: MIKE NERVOUS & MANDIZ [Extended Set]\nTyler Hill 
 | Nour\n\nAdvance Tickets: https://wiggleroomtoronto.com/event/nervous-re
 cords-mike-nervous-mandiz-extended-set/\nEarly Wiggler: $25\nThe Wiggler:
  $30\n\n\nStraight outta NYC\, Mike Nervous\, label boss of the legendary
  Nervous Records and a true OG of the dance music scene\, goes back-to-ba
 ck with Montreal’s rising talent Mandiz\, bringing fresh energy and serio
 us heat to the dance floor.\n\nGet ready for an extended B2B set where NY
 C house music history meets the next wave of underground talent. With Man
 diz holding down a bi-monthly residency at Wiggle Room\, this is a link-u
 p built for the heads\, the dancers\, and everyone who lives for the boun
 cy beats.\n\n\nAdvance Tickets: https://wiggleroomtoronto.com/event/nervo
 us-records-mike-nervous-mandiz-extended-set/\nEarly Wiggler: $25\nThe Wig
 gler: $30\n\nPerformances:\n10-11:30 Nour\n11:30-1 Tyler Hill\n1-1:30 Mik
 e Nervous\n1:30-2 Mandiz\n2-close Mike Nervous b2b Mandiz\n\n\n\n#WiggleR
 oomToronto is the #HomeofBouncyBeats\nOptions for prepaid table/ticket pa
 ckages (ONE ticket = everything mentioned):\n\n1) The 3rd Wheel: $363\nIn
 cludes: 3 General Admissions\; 1 Bottle of Stoli Vodka\n\n2) Regular Pack
 age: $700\nIncludes: 6 General Admissions\; 2 Regular Bottles of Choice (
 may email wigglyevents@gmail.com mailto:wigglyevents@gmail.com to specify
  choice)\n\n3) Premium Package: $900\nIncludes: 6 General Admissions\; 2 
 Premium Bottles of Choice (email wigglyevents@gmail.com mailto:wigglyeven
 ts@gmail.com to specify choice)\n\nTo Arrange Special Packages: wigglyeve
 nts@gmail.com mailto:wigglyevents@gmail.com (sold separately from admissi
 on)\n\nATM on site\nFull Bar Service\n21+ event\n\nHosted by: 1lvl1 Enter
 tainment\; Wiggly Events\; Wiggle Room Toronto\; Sunshine Frequencies\; T
 oronto House Community\n\n~ WiGGLE RESPONSIBLY ~\nWe have a strict code o
 f conduct and reserve the right to refuse anyone at any time. Wiggle Room
  is a Safer Dance Space. We take this very seriously. We encourage everyo
 ne not to hesitate to bring to our attention anything you think that we s
 hould be made aware of\, such as harassment\, violation of personal space
 \, solicitation or use of controlled substances\, over-intoxicated behavi
 our\, or anything else that may pose a risk or discomfort to you or other
 s. You may use the safe word BANANA\, ask any of our staff for a Banana\,
  and we will direct you to a safe\, quiet space. Our security staff are i
 n marked clothing. Our team and event hosts\, such as Takin\, Lindsay Fay
 \, Nour Bawab\, Christina Barron\, Tyler Hill\, Mitch (lead security)\, a
 nd Tanya\, are all available.\n\n~ Wiggle Wiggle ~\n772 Dundas St West
CATEGORIES:DJ/Club/Rave,Wiggle-Room
