DESCRIPTION:Address:\nCheck event page for more details.\n\nFrequency & Fl
 ow | R&B Yoga\nFrequency & Flow is an immersive wellness experience where 
 the sonic meets the somatic through live music\, yoga\, breathwork\, and c
 ommunity connection.\nAfter celebrating Club Enhergy’s five-year anniver
 sary with our first Frequency & Flow last month\, we’re running it back 
 for a second time and one final edition at Club Enhergy as the space prepa
 res to close its doors.\nLed by Eboni Morgan\, founder of At the Root Well
 ness and certified yoga teacher\, alongside DJ Liv.digital\, this all-leve
 ls experience blends R&B\, mindful movement\, breathwork\, and community c
 onnection…\n\nHosted by At the Root Wellness & Liv Digital
