SUMMARY: Sunday SerVice: MARK FARINA [Mushroom Jazz to House Extended Set
 ]
DESCRIPTION:Thank Goodness It's Sunday :)\n\nRSVP & Advance Tickets: http
 s://wiggleroomtoronto.com/event/sunday-service-mark-farina-mushroom-jazz-
 to-house-extended-set-3/\nDo You Know Who I Am? (FREE Entry before 9pm)\n
 Super Early Wiggler: $25\nThe Wiggler: $30\n\nToronto\, you already know 
 what happens when Mark Farina takes us on this journey. Every time he's b
 rought this special set to Wiggle Room\, we've SOLD OUT!\n\nGet ready for
  a truly unforgettable musical experience. Mark starts things off deep in
  his signature Mushroom Jazz territory\, weaving together eclectic sounds
 \, jazzy grooves\, soulful rhythms and unexpected musical gems. Then\, as
  the hours roll by\, he gradually turns up the energy\, building the vibe
  into the irresistible\, bouncy house music we all love.\n\nIt's a musica
 l journey that unfolds naturally\, taking you from trippy grooves to full
 -on dance floor euphoria.\n\nPut on your Sunday best\, sip your tips\, or
  ride that bender. Join us for a late check-out and reset your week at Wi
 ggle Room at the Industry Weekly Social.\n\nEvery funky Sunday funday\, a
 t your service!\nwith Toronto's finest: MANZONE & STRONG https://on.sound
 cloud.com/yjJCoMeTijpVkmAEA and the Wiggly family.\nCOMPLIMENTARY Entry b
 efore 9pm with RSVP\nOpen at 8pm\n\n\nit's a Sunday thang...\n\nSun Dec 1
 3: MARK FARINA | Manzone & Strong | Mr Haze\nLast year\, when Mark Farina
  played at Sunday SerVice\, we were sold out\, and we anticipate a sold-o
 ut show again. Please get your tickets in advance and arrive early.\n\nRS
 VP & Advance Tickets: https://wiggleroomtoronto.com/event/sunday-service-
 mark-farina-mushroom-jazz-to-house-extended-set-3/\nDo You Know Who I Am?
  (FREE Entry before 9pm)\nSuper Early Wiggler: $25\nThe Wiggler: $30\n\nP
 erformers:\n8-9:30: Mr Haze\n9:30-11: MARK FARINA (Mushroom Jazz)\n11-1+:
  MARK FARINA (House)\n-close: Manzone & Strong\nVJ Amir Nian\n\nTo Arrang
 e Special Packages & Table Reservations - wigglyevents@gmail.com mailto:w
 igglyevents@gmail.com (sold separately from admission)\n\nATM on site\nFu
 ll Bar Service\n19+ event\n\nhosted by: Toronto House Community / Wiggly 
 Events / Manzone & Strong / Wiggle Room Toronto\n\n~ WiGGLE RESPONSIBLY ~
 \nWe have a strict code of conduct and reserve the right to refuse anyone
  at any time. Wiggle Room is a Safer Dance Space. We take this very serio
 usly. We encourage everyone not to hesitate to bring to our attention any
 thing you think that we should be made aware of\, such as harassment\, vi
 olation of personal space\, solicitation or use of controlled substances\
 , over-intoxicated behaviour\, or anything else that may pose a risk or d
 iscomfort to you or others. You may use the safe word BANANA\, ask any of
  our staff for a Banana\, and we will direct you to a safe\, quiet space.
  Our security staff are in marked clothing. Our team and event hosts\, su
 ch as Takin\, Lindsay Fay\, Tyler Hill\, DTM (coat check)\, Mitch (lead s
 ecurity)\, and Monique or Jen (bar) are all available.\n\n~ Wiggle Wiggle
  ~\n772 Dundas St West
CATEGORIES:DJ/Club/Rave,Wiggle-Room
X-TKF-FEATURED-IMAGE:https://d3flpus5evl89n.cloudfront.net/6755f3e6a02aaf
 1c2599e757/6af64c1233339b9bfdbec3e3/scaled_1024.jpg
