DESCRIPTION:Designing a course can be overwhelming!  Whether you need mot
 ivation to get started\, want concrete strategies to structure your curric
 ulum\, or are seeking a community of engaged instructors to connect with\,
  the integrated course design workshop is for you. \nGuided by Fink’s m
 odel of Integrated Course Design and Universal Design for Learning (UDL)\,
  session 1 will focus on using completely constructed course learning outc
 omes to generate ideas for course assessments. \nSession 2 will consist o
 f small-group problem solving where each participant will have time to sha
 re an aspect of their course design they are working through with opportun
 ity to receive feedback or suggestions from group members.\nRegister throu
 gh YULearn (requires Passport York sign-in) using our registration form ( 
 https://yulearn.yorku.ca/local/yulearn/learning_opportunity.php?id=2264 ).
 \n
