UID:6ae8ed6c96ec3a003adecb73@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Join us in the Youth Hub for an Art Workshop led by Kyungmi Le
 e. Explore the beauty of the Korean Moon Jar and traditional mother-of-pe
 arl craft through a contemporary hands-on art experience. Using genuine mo
 ther-of-pearl pieces\, participants decorate a pre-made Moon Jar form with
  their own colour and pattern design\, creating a unique 4 x 4-inch artwor
 k to take home. Beginner-friendly and no previous art experience required.
 \nThis program is part of Youth Hub service. Youth Hubs are a welcoming pl
 ace for teens after school and in the summer\, where helpful staff are alw
 ays available. Free\, nutritious snacks are offered daily. Drop by a bra
 nch with a\nYouth Hub\nor call the branch to find out more.
LOCATION:Maria A. Shchuka\, Youth Hub
