SUMMARY:The Meaning of Dreams
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261217T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261217T153000
UID:6af1f632ad4027659156a799@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Psychotherapist\, Ann Schnurr\, explores how dreams have infor
 med us through the ages\, Jung and Freud's use of dreams and the many ways
  dream interpretation has evolved.  In this interactive program\, Ann will
  provide some examples of dreams and their interpretations\, and participa
 nts may volunteer to share a dream they've experienced and the individual 
 and group can discuss their interpretation of it.\nInformation Collection 
 Notice:\nThe personal information on this form is collected by the Toronto
  Public Library under the Public Libraries Act\, sections 20(a)\, 20(c)\, 
 and 20(d). The information will only be used for event and program registr
 ation\, delivery and evaluation. Questions about how the library handles y
 our information can be directed to Answerline staff at\nanswerline@tpl.ca\
 n\, 416-397-5981\, 789 Yonge Street\, Toronto ON M4W 2G8.
