DESCRIPTION:A Christmas Carol like you've never seen it before!\n\nThe cr
 itically acclaimed holiday comedy INVASION: CHRISTMAS CAROL returns to Th
 e Assembly Theatre in Toronto this December.\n\nIt starts with six actors
  performing Dickens' classic tale of Ebenezer Scrooge. But about five min
 utes into the show\, a surprise guest "Invader" crashes the story as a ch
 aracter of their own creation. The cast has no idea who they're playing a
 nd must improvise their way through the chaos while somehow keeping Scroo
 ge's journey toward redemption on track.\n\nDifferent Invader. Different 
 show. Every night.\n\nThis year's special guests include PRIYANKA (Decemb
 er 6)\, ANDREW PHUNG (December 10)\, and COLIN MOCHRIE (December 17)\, al
 ongside a rotating lineup of surprise performers.\n\n"Hilarious and uplif
 ting." — Sesaya Arts Magazine\n\nDecember 2–20\, 2026 | 8 PM\nThe Assembl
 y Theatre | 1479 Queen Street West\, Toronto\n\nTickets and full performa
 nce schedule:\nhttps://www.eventbrite.ca/e/invasion-christmas-carol-2026-
 tickets-1997087244709 https://www.eventbrite.ca/e/invasion-christmas-caro
 l-2026-tickets-1997087244709
CATEGORIES:Comedy,The-Assembly-Theatre,Dance---Performance---Theatre
