DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261218T120000
UID:6af2188febad2200454b7ae0@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Join us every month for a free afternoon movie.\nThis month's 
 movie:\nThe Man Who Invented Christmas\nThe journey that led to Charles Di
 ckens' creation of 'A Christmas Carol\,' a timeless tale that would redefi
 ne the holiday.\nLight refreshments served before the movie.
LOCATION:Hillcrest\, Auditorium
