UID:6aeb5a51035faf0033e152d4@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Are you new to Canada? Would you like to say “thank you” t
 o someone special during Christmas? Join us to create your own handmade gi
 fts\, make new friends\, and learn new skills! This workshop is perfect fo
 r beginners who want to learn the basics of paper folding art.\nThe worksh
 op will be in English and Mandarin.\nJoin us! This is a FREE workshop. The
  materials will be provided.\nIn partnership with Immigration\, Refugees a
 nd Citizenship Canada\, CultureLink Settlement & Community Services & Tor
 onto Public Library
