DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261218T113000
UID:69f6380266c3387a9d08a533@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Enjoy some light refreshments\, and informal discussion about 
 services in the neighbourhood. Get to know your local library staff and le
 t us know what information and resources you would like to access at the l
 ibrary and in the community.\nSnacks and refreshments are provided for all
  participants. Ingredient lists will be available at the program.\nNo Regi
 stration Required.  All are welcome!\nMeet staff from Unison Health and C
 ommunity Services. Unison Health and Community Services provides programs 
 and services to people of all ages\, cultures\, and backgrounds. Unison se
 rvices are free\, confidential\, and non-judgemental. In partnership with 
 Hennick Humber Hospital\, come and learn where and how you can register fo
 r a family doctor or nurse practitioner\, and explore healthcare resources
  available in your community.
