SUMMARY:C4 Fall Capstone Day 2026
DTSTART:20261218T140000Z
DTEND:20261218T170000Z
DTSTAMP:20261030T040100Z
UID:MEC-8d16fcbd56cdafde0fc1ba4e68c4636c@events.yorku.ca
RECURRENCE-ID:20261218T140000Z
SEQUENCE:2
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://events.yorku.ca/wp-content/uploads/2026/1
 0/York-Capstone-Day-Invitation-Dec-2026.png
CATEGORIES:Co-op &amp\; Career Centre,Faculties,Students
CLASS:PUBLIC
CREATED:20261029
DESCRIPTION:About Capstone Day\nCapstone Day ( https://www.yorku.ca/c4/eve
 nts/fall-capstone-day-2026/ ) is a showcase\, at which students present th
 eir completed capstone and pre-capstone projects and compete for awards. T
 his is a great opportunity for students to share their project experience 
 and develop professional skills to enhance their career-readiness.\nExcite
 d to learn more?\nCelebrate C4 student success at the public\, pan-campus 
 event\, Fall Capstone Day ( https://www.yorku.ca/c4/events/fall-capstone-
 day-2026/ ). This event will be held on December 18th from 9:00am until 
 12:00pm. C4 students wrap up their project journey by sharing their findin
 gs and competing for awards.\nThis event brings project partners and mento
 rs together with the entire York community to celebrate the innovation\, c
 reativity\, ambition\, and impact of our students working on SDG-related p
 rojects.\nEvent Schedule:\nProject Touring 10:00-11:30am\nAwards Ceremony 
 11:30am-12:00pm\nSign up to Attend Fall Capstone Day: Fall Capstone Day 20
 26 | C4: Cross-Campus Capstone Classroom ( https://www.yorku.ca/c4/events/
 fall-capstone-day-2026/ )\n
LAST-MODIFIED:20261029
LOCATION:Collaboratory\, Scott Library (Second Floor) @ 4700 Keele St\, No
 rth York\, ON M3J 2S5
ORGANIZER;CN="C4 Class (Cross-Campus Capstone Classroom)":MAILTO:akalmin@y
 orku.ca
PRIORITY:5
TRANSP:OPAQUE
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/c4-fall-capstone-day-2026/
X-SOURCE:York University
END:VEVENT
