DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261218T153000
UID:6aebb10efb96d55bb888d17b@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:In this session\, you will learn what apps are and how they’
 re used across different Apple devices. This class covers the differences 
 between pre-installed\, free\, and paid apps. You will also learn how to a
 ccess and navigate the Apple App Store and how to safely download and use 
 apps.\nInformation Collection Notice:\nThe personal information on this fo
 rm is collected by the Toronto Public Library under the Public Libraries A
 ct\, sections 20(a)\, 20(c)\, and 20(d). The information will only be used
  for event and program registration\, delivery and evaluation. Questions a
 bout how the library handles your information can be directed to Answerlin
 e staff at\nanswerline@tpl.ca\n\, 416-397-5981\, 789 Yonge Street\, Toront
 o ON M4W 2G8.
