SUMMARY: The Greatest Showman Sing Along at TIFF Lightbox
DESCRIPTION:Calling all dreamers — join us for a night of dancing\, singi
 ng\, and wonder with a special screening of The Greatest Showman\, hosted
  by comedian/ringleader Martha Chaves!\n\nDust off your top hat or your b
 est aerial attire for a participatory screening of the 2017 musical that 
 tells a fantastical version of P.T. Barnum’s life and his world-famous Ba
 rnum & Bailey Circus.\n\nThis event features warm-up activities\, props\,
  and onscreen lyrics so the whole audience can perform. We encourage you 
 to arrive early for photo opportunities outside the cinema.\n\nLadies and
  gents\, this is the moment you’ve waited for — sing your heart out at TI
 FF Lightbox this December!
