 ing paper cones into gorgeous\, textured yarn Christmas trees!\nWhether yo
 u want to keep it minimalistic\, make it super colorful\, or load it up wi
 th sparkly decorations\, you’ll leave with your very own handmade holida
 y tree.\nCome enjoy great music\, snacks\, and a relaxed space to hang out
