DESCRIPTION:Explore colours\, experiment with different techniques\, and c
 reate your own unique artwork to take home. Whether you’re an experience
 d artist or picking up a paintbrush for the first time\, this is a great o
 pportunity to express yourself\, try something new\, and connect with othe
 r creative teens.\nThis program is part of Youth Hub service. Youth Hubs a
 re a welcoming place for teens after school and in the summer\, where help
 ful staff are always available. Free\, nutritious snacks are offered dail
 y. Drop by a branch with a\nYouth Hub\nor call the branch to find out mor
 e.\nThe Mount Dennis Youth Hub is for youth that are 13-17 years old in gr
 ades 8-12.
LOCATION:Mount Dennis
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6adb8f9a9d27a0004552dd8a
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Teens
END:VEVENT
