SUMMARY: Boxing Day: KENNY GLASGOW [House Set]
DESCRIPTION:Sat Dec 26: KENNY GLASGOW\nManzone & Strong | TAKiN | Nour\n\
 nAdvance Tickets [Boxing Day pricing]: https://wiggleroomtoronto.com/even
 t/boxing-day-special-kenny-glasgow-house-set/\nEarly Wiggler: $15\nThe Wi
 ggler: $20\n\nHometown hero KENNY GLASGOW returns to Wiggle Room for our 
 annual Boxing Day Beats playing a special house set. Toronto's finest on 
 this lineup\, including Manzone & Strong\, TAKiN\, and opening vibes by N
 our.\n\nPerformances:\n10-12 NOUR\n12-1 TAKiN\n1-3 KENNY GLASGOW\n3-close
  Manzone & Strong\n\n\n#WiggleRoomToronto is the #HomeofBouncyBeats\nOpti
 ons for prepaid table/ticket packages (ONE ticket = everything mentioned)
 :\n\n1) The 3rd Wheel: $363\nIncludes: 3 General Admissions\; 1 Bottle of
  Stoli Vodka\n\n2) Regular Package: $700\nIncludes: 6 General Admissions\
 ; 2 Regular Bottles of Choice (may email wigglyevents@gmail.com mailto:wi
 gglyevents@gmail.com to specify choice)\n\n3) Premium Package: $900\nIncl
 udes: 6 General Admissions\; 2 Premium Bottles of Choice (email wigglyeve
 nts@gmail.com mailto:wigglyevents@gmail.com to specify choice)\n\nTo Arra
 nge Special Packages: wigglyevents@gmail.com mailto:wigglyevents@gmail.co
 m (sold separately from admission)\n\nATM on site\nFull Bar Service\n21+ 
 event\n\nHosted by: Wiggly Events\; Wiggle Room Toronto\; Sunshine Freque
 ncies\; OG Entertainment\n\n~ WiGGLE RESPONSIBLY ~\nWe have a strict code
  of conduct and reserve the right to refuse anyone at any time. Wiggle Ro
 om is a Safer Dance Space. We take this very seriously. We encourage ever
 yone not to hesitate to bring to our attention anything you think that we
  should be made aware of\, such as harassment\, violation of personal spa
 ce\, solicitation or use of controlled substances\, over-intoxicated beha
 viour\, or anything else that may pose a risk or discomfort to you or oth
 ers. You may use the safe word BANANA\, ask any of our staff for a Banana
 \, and we will direct you to a safe\, quiet space. Our security staff are
  in marked clothing. Our team and event hosts\, such as Takin\, Lindsay F
 ay\, Nour Bawab\, Christina Barron\, Tyler Hill\, Mitch (lead security)\,
  and Tanya\, are all available.\n\n~ Wiggle Wiggle ~\n772 Dundas St West
