DESCRIPTION:Thank Goodness It's Sunday :)\n\nRSVP & Advance Tickets: http
 s://wiggleroomtoronto.com/event/sunday-service-digiram-buf-manzone-strong
 /\nThe Wiggler: $23 (includes Coat or Bag Check)\nDo you know who I am? (
 FREE before 10pm)\n\nPut on your Sunday best\, sip your tips\, or ride th
 at bender. Join us for a late check-out and reset your week at Wiggle Roo
 m at the Industry Weekly Social.\n\n#WiggleRoomToronto is the #HomeofBoun
 cyBeats\n\n\nEvery funky Sunday funday\, at your service!\nwith Toronto's
  finest: MANZONE & STRONG https://on.soundcloud.com/yjJCoMeTijpVkmAEA and
  the Wiggly family.\nCOMPLIMENTARY Entry before 10pm with RSVP\nOpen at 8
 pm\n\n\nit's a Sunday thang...\n\nSun Dec 27: Digiram [Buffalo] | Manzone
  & Strong | Barroness | KTD\n\nRSVP & Advance Tickets:\nThe Wiggler: $23 
