DESCRIPTION:Come and join our adult and senior's social as we engage in va
 rious activities\, games and crafts. Relax\, have fun\, and learn somethin
 g new while connecting with new friends. There is a different activity eac
 h week. This is a drop-in program.\nActivities for November:\nMon\, Nov 2
  - Snap Circuits\nMon\, Nov 9 - Painting\nMon\, Nov 16 - Collage\nMon\, No
 v 23 - Bingo\nMon\, Nov 30 - Crafts
