UID:6af4f18008e64c003ab891d2@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Looking for something to do after school? Come out to our Afte
 r School Club and learn new things\, make stuff\, meet other kids and have
  fun!\nFor ages [\n6-12.]\nSnacks are offered during the After School Club
  for participants. Ingredient lists will be available. Snacks are generous
 ly supported\, in part\, by donors.\nAfter School Club: Snap Circuits\nPla
 y with electricity and circuitry during this hand-on program. Turn on ligh
 t\, spin a motor\, activate a speaker and choose from hundreds of differen
 t projects. Or try making your own circuits!
LOCATION:McGregor Park
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6af4f18008e64c003ab891d2
