DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261228T190000
UID:6aeb7123198b996a80aa0fe8@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Kick off the weekend by playing video games at the Youth Hub! 
 We have games for PS5\, PS4\, and Nintendo Switch 2\, so there's something
  for everyone.\nThis program is part of Youth Hub service. Youth Hubs are 
 a welcoming place for teens after school and in the summer\, where helpful
  staff are always available. Free\, nutritious snacks are offered daily.
  Drop by a branch with a\nYouth Hub\nor call the branch to find out more.
LOCATION:Maria A. Shchuka\, Youth Hub
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6aeb7123198b996a80aa0fe8
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Teens
