DESCRIPTION:Join us bi-weekly to learn a new crafting skill and work on a 
 project\; starting with sewing felt! Make keychains\, bag charms\, or Chri
 stmas ornaments. This is a guided program where participants work on a pro
 ject over a series of weeks.
