UID:6ac94070ebad2200454442ac@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Join us every month at the College/Shaw Library for our Adult
  Crafternoon Social!\nDrop in for some coffee and light music while explor
 ing your creative abilities with a simple craft or art project. A great op
 portunity for adults and seniors to socialize in a relaxed and friendly s
 pace. Materials provided\, but feel free to bring in something you're alre
 ady working on!\nWed Nov 25 - Christmas Crafts\nWed Dec 30 - Collage
LOCATION:College/Shaw\, Basement auditorium
