SUMMARY:GTApreneurs January 6\, 2027 Toronto Business Networking Event
DESCRIPTION:Toronto Women in Business Networking Group (TWIB)\n\\*\\*To at
 tend\, please go here to COMPLETE YOUR REGISTRATION: [https://gtapreneurs.
 com/networking-events-toronto](https://gtapreneurs.com/networking-events-t
 oronto)\n\nJoin us for a vibrant Business Networking Event in Toronto wher
 e you may meet your next client or referral partner. Discover opportunitie
 s and connect! Register now.\n\n* **VENUE:** Office Evolution\n* **ADDRESS
 :** 197 Yonge St\, Suites 201 & 202 Toronto\, ON (Across from CF Eaton Cen
 tre)\n* **TRANSIT:** Get off at Queen subway station\, walk through the ma
 ll\, up to the 2nd floor and out the front door.\n* **PARKING:** Under Eat
 on Centre (payment required)\n\n**EVENT ITINERARY:**\n\n* **6:00-6:55pm:**
  Open networking\n* **6:55-7:05pm:** Host & Sponsor presentations\n* **7:0
 5-8:00pm:** Open networking\n\n\\*Appetizers and refreshments provided.\n\
 n**TICKETS:** $20\n\n***\\*Includes a Guest Contact Sheet*** emailed to yo
 u the day after the event. Note: You need to attend the event to receive t
 he sheet.\n\n**HOSTS:**\n**Tammy Defoe\,** President of GTApreneurs\nLearn
  more about Tammy’s Coaching services at www.gtapreneurs.com/business-co
 aching-toronto\n\n**QUESTIONS ABOUT THE EVENT?** Call 416-522-7770 or emai
 l info@gtapreneurs.com\n\nand\n\n**Mohammad Reza Sadeghian\,** Managing Di
 rector at Office Evolution.\n\nMohammad is the Manager at Office Evolution
  Downtown Toronto\, where he leads the growth of a flexible and profession
 al workspace for entrepreneurs and businesses. He is dedicated to building
  a collaborative community and supporting clients in achieving their busin
 ess goals.\n\n**CONTACT MOHAMMAD:** [www.officeevolution.com/locations/can
 ada/ontario/toronto](www.officeevolution.com/locations/canada/ontario/toro
 nto) \\| 416\\-540\\-0856 \\| mohammad\\.sadeghian@officeevolution\\.com\n
 \nView all of GTApreneurs events and services at www.gtapreneurs.com\n\nWe
  look forward to seeing you there!
