 ormal English class.\nThis program is in partnership with WoodGreen Commun
 ity Services.\nAfter registering online\, you will be contacted by WoodGre
 en staff to complete your registration.\nInformation Collection Notice:\nT
 he personal information on this form is collected by the Toronto Public Li
 brary under the Public Libraries Act\, sections 20(a)\, 20(c)\, and 20(d).
