DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20270113T143000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20270113T160000
UID:6ac516c1a85a2c00337d8e0b@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:An introduction to using iMovie on the Mac. Basic video editin
 g techniques will be demonstrated.  The techniques include using transit
 ions and titles\, adding audio and a soundtrack\, cutting and splicing\, a
 nd using the timeline.\nApple laptops with iMovie installed will be provid
 ed for the class.\nRegistration is required.\nInformation Collection Notic
 e:\nThe personal information on this form is collected by the Toronto Publ
 ic Library under the Public Libraries Act\, sections 20(a)\, 20(c)\, and 2
 0(d). The information will only be used for event and program registration
 \, delivery and evaluation. Questions about how the library handles your i
 nformation can be directed to Answerline staff at\nanswerline@tpl.ca\n\, 4
 16-397-5981\, 789 Yonge Street\, Toronto ON M4W 2G8.
LOCATION:Fort York\, Digital Innovation Hub 2nd Floor\,\nRoom 1
