ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://events.yorku.ca/wp-content/uploads/2026/1
 1/DoS-2027W-PeerMentorshipDay-Digital-Social-JL-Final_Keele-EventCalendar-
 1.png
CATEGORIES:Advising,BE-YU,Co-op &amp\; Career Centre,Colleges,Faculties,Fa
 culty of Environmental &amp\; Urban Change,Faculty of Liberal Arts &amp\; 
 Professional Studies,Glendon,Learning Commons,Markham Campus,Student Acces
 sibility Services,Student Counselling, Health &amp\; Well-being,Students,t
 he Atkinson Centre for Mature and Part-time Students,VPS Communications
CLASS:PUBLIC
CREATED:20261112
DESCRIPTION:Discover peer mentorship supports from across York\, all in 
 one place! Connect with peer mentors from Keele Campus in the Vari Hal
 l Rotunda\, Glendon Campus in the Breezeway & Markham Campus in the 1st Fl
 oor West Atrium to ask questions and explore mentorship opportunities. Cha
 t with students who have been in your position and gain valuable insights\
 , tips and advice that go beyond websites and textbooks.\nVisit the Keele
  Campus in the Vari Hall Rotunda\, Glendon Campus in the Breezeway & Mar
 kham Campus in the 1st Floor West Atrium  during Peer Mentorship Day to:\
 n\nmeet peer mentors from across York\;\nexplore supports\;\nsign up fo
 r a mentorship program (or learn how to become a mentor!)\;\nmake a friend
 ship bracelet\;\nand more.\n\nWednesday\, Jan. 13\n10 a.m. to 2 p.m. \nNo
  registration required. \n
LAST-MODIFIED:20261112
LOCATION:Vari Hall Rotunda
PRIORITY:5
TRANSP:OPAQUE
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/peer-mentorship-day-3/
