X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Events": "https://events.yorku.ca/events/beyond-the-academy-2027/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:events
SUMMARY:Beyond the Academy 2027
DTSTART:20270118T150000Z
DTEND:20270118T170000Z
DTSTAMP:20261110T165800Z
UID:MEC-435c53251dc1f41d8d6b80f8592f6650@events.yorku.ca__20270118
SEQUENCE:1
CATEGORIES:LA&amp\;PS Colleges,LA&amp\;PS Students-Graduate
CLASS:PUBLIC
CREATED:20261110
DESCRIPTION:Beyond the Academy is a five-week applied professional develop
 ment program designed to help LA&PS PhD students:\n• Understand the land
 scape of non-academic careers.\n• Reflect on personal values and strengt
 hs.\n• Translate academic experience into professional competencies.\n
 • Build professional networks and online presence.\n• Develop concrete
  strategies for career exploration and job searching.\nThe program will be
  cohort-based\, combining reflective exercises\, practical workshops\, and
  alumni engagement. It will culminate in an actionable career plan and pro
 fessional online profile for each participant.\nTo apply to the program\, 
 please complete the required registration form:\nBeyond the Academy Regist
 ration Form\n
LAST-MODIFIED:20261110
ORGANIZER;CN="Marco Sestito":MAILTO:msestito@yorku.ca
PRIORITY:5
TRANSP:OPAQUE
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/beyond-the-academy-2027/
X-SOURCE:York University
END:VEVENT
