BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Torontobotanicalgarden": "https://torontobotanicalgarden.ca/event/belonging-a-sense-of-place-6-week-art-therapy-workshop/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:torontobotanicalgarden
X-SOURCE:Toronto Botanical Garden
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20270120T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20270224T120000
DTSTAMP:20261114T011902
CREATED:20261113T182635Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20261113T182737Z
UID:10002051-1800439200-1803470400@torontobotanicalgarden.ca
SUMMARY:Belonging: A Sense of Place : 6-Week Art Therapy Workshop
DESCRIPTION:Join Mahja Kabir\, an artist and art therapy trainee\, for a six-week closed art therapy group for adults!\nBelonging: A Sense of Place invites participants to slow down\, connect with nature\, and explore their inner world through creative expression. Each session includes a brief meditation\, gentle check-in\, nature-inspired art-making\, and optional sharing.\n \nAcross the six weeks\, the garden becomes both a setting and a metaphor for exploring themes of memory\, identity\, place\, belonging\, relationship\, and what makes somewhere feel like “home.” Each session introduces a distinct theme while contributing to an overarching exploration of belonging and our relationship with the natural world.\n \nAs a closed group\, participants are invited to attend all six sessions. The continuity of the series offers opportunities to build trust\, develop connections\, and deepen reflection as the sessions unfold.\n \nThe group is facilitated by Mahja Kabir\, an artist and art therapy trainee who creates gentle\, creative spaces that support reflection\, care\, growth\, and connection. Art therapy uses the creative process as a way to explore emotions\, experiences\, relationships\, and self-awareness\, with no emphasis on artistic skill or producing a finished artwork.\n \nWednesdays\, January 20 through February 24\, 10 a.m. to 12 p.m. (six sessions).\nPublic $120\, TBG Members $90 (plus applicable taxes and fees).\n \nJoin Toronto Botanical Garden\n \nJoin the Toronto Botanical Garden (TBG) as a member to get a discount on this program\, upcoming events and classes\, and free parking. A TBG membership helps you deepen your knowledge and connection to the natural world\, become a part of a dynamic community of plant people\, and be inspired! Become a member!\n \nAdditional Program Information\n\n\n\nPlease review our Refund Policy and Terms of Agreement.\nFor more information on accessibility at the garden please review our Accessibility Features webpage. If you have any accessibility requirements during your program please email programsupport@torontobotanicalgarden.ca.\nTo learn more about the Toronto Botanical Garden and our programs\, please review our list of Frequently Asked Questions.
URL:https://torontobotanicalgarden.ca/event/belonging-a-sense-of-place-6-week-art-therapy-workshop/
LOCATION:Toronto Botanical Garden\, 777 Lawrence Avenue East\, Toronto\, ON\, M3C 1P2\, Canada
CATEGORIES:Art,Wellness
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://torontobotanicalgarden.ca/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/00d2cf677168fc96076a1408fe9c1fad.jpg
END:VEVENT
