SUMMARY:Cookbook Club
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20270120T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20270120T150000
UID:6aef8bb4de685359098eb2b7@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Attention\, culinary enthusiasts! Every month\, take a cookboo
 k home\, experiment with a recipe\, and share your verdict. No time to coo
 k? No problem! Join us and share your love for cooking or your quest to di
 scover it.\nRegistration required. Please speak to Malvern Staff to obtain
  a copy of the book.\nAt our January meeting\, we will be discussing:\nDe
 liciously Nourishing Eats: Allergy-friendly Recipes for Quick\, Satisfyin
 g Whole Food Meals\nby Aleyda Batarse.\nInformation Collection Notice:\nTh
 e personal information on this form is collected by the Toronto Public Lib
 rary under the Public Libraries Act\, sections 20(a)\, 20(c)\, and 20(d). 
 The information will only be used for event and program registration\, del
 ivery and evaluation. Questions about how the library handles your inform
 ation can be directed to Answerline staff at\nanswerline@tpl.ca\n\, 416-39
 7-5981\, 789 Yonge Street\, Toronto ON M4W 2G8.
LOCATION:Malvern\, Community Room
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6aef8bb4de685359098eb2b7
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Older Adults
END:VEVENT
