SUMMARY:Learning By Doing: Fieldwork\, Internships & Study Abroad Opportun
 ities
DTSTART:20270120T233000Z
DTEND:20270121T003000Z
DTSTAMP:20261109T182000Z
UID:MEC-608b78a38cd26383321b54a3b02f68db@events.yorku.ca
