ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://events.yorku.ca/wp-content/uploads/2026/
 11/LearningByDoingEmailBanner@2x-100.jpg
CATEGORIES:Faculty of Environmental &amp\; Urban Change
CLASS:PUBLIC
CREATED:20261109
DESCRIPTION:Wondering what learning looks like beyond the classroom? Join 
 the Faculty of Environmental & Urban Change (EUC) to explore the hands-on 
 learning opportunities available to students throughout their degree. Disc
 over how fieldwork\, internships\, community-based experiences\, and study
  abroad programs can help you build practical skills\, expand your global 
 perspective\, and prepare for future career opportunities. Learn how stude
 nts apply their knowledge in real-world settings\, gain valuable professio
 nal experience\, and make meaningful connections both locally and internat
 ionally. Whether you’re interested in environmental issues\, urban devel
 opment\, sustainability\, or social change\, this session will show you ho
 w EUC’s experiential learning opportunities can enhance your academic jo
 urney and help you stand out in the job market.\nRegister: https://yorku.z
 oom.us/meeting/register/yEEJpFPpRoGkQZ-KhDKNqw#/registration\n
LAST-MODIFIED:20261109
PRIORITY:5
TRANSP:OPAQUE
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/learning-by-doing-fieldwork-internships
 -study-abroad-opportunities/
X-SOURCE:York University
END:VEVENT
