DESCRIPTION:Join a staff-moderated discussion of select nonfiction titles.
  Explore different types of nonfiction\, real-life stories\, biographies/m
 emoirs\, gain new knowledge\, and engage in lively discussions.\nThis mont
 h's featured title is\nCareless People\nby Sarah Wynn-Williams.\nThis prog
 ram is hosted on\nZoom\n. The Zoom information and link will be shared ove
 r email.\nInformation Collection Notice:\nThe personal information on this
  form is collected by the Toronto Public Library under the Public Librarie
 s Act\, sections 20(a)\, 20(c)\, and 20(d). The information will only be u
