DESCRIPTION:Join the Macaulay Child Development Centre Wednesday mornings
  (10:30-12:30) for Play & Learn! This weekly program is for parents\, ca
 regivers and their children (ages 0-6) to socialize with others in an inte
 ractive learning environment. Children will learn\, explore\, communicate 
 and understand new concepts to help expand their knowledge through play-ba
 sed and guided activities. Expect a story time from Annette Street Librar
 y staff on the first Wednesday and the last Thursday of each month!
