BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Events": "https://events.yorku.ca/events/love-that-for-you-268/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:events
SUMMARY:Love That For You
DTSTART:20270210T160000Z
DTEND:20270210T190000Z
DTSTAMP:20260804T210800Z
UID:MEC-57e289de16e78690c58902a1eb00c835@events.yorku.ca
RECURRENCE-ID:20270210T160000Z
SEQUENCE:10
CATEGORIES:LA&amp\;PS Colleges
CLASS:PUBLIC
CREATED:20260804
DESCRIPTION:\n\n\n\n\nLooking for a fun way to connect with other first-ye
 ar students and spread a little positivity this semester? Join us for LA&P
 S Love That for You! 💖\nThis Valentine’s-inspired celebration is all 
 about friendship\, self-care\, and creating meaningful connections in a we
 lcoming and inclusive environment. Drop in to meet new people\, take a bre
 ak from your studies\, and enjoy an afternoon filled with feel-good activi
 ties designed just for LA&PS first-year students.\nGet creative by making 
 Valentine’s cards\, crafting colourful pipe-cleaner flowers\, and explor
 ing other hands-on activities. Capture memories with friends at our photo 
 booth\, and spend some time with therapy dogs for the ultimate stress-reli
 eving study break.\nOf course\, there will also be free food\, snacks\, an
 d plenty of opportunities to relax\, socialize\, and enjoy the positive vi
 bes. Whether you come with friends or arrive on your own\, you’ll find a
  welcoming community ready to celebrate kindness\, connection\, and belong
 ing. Stay for the whole event or drop in between classes\, we’d love to 
 see you there!\nWe can’t wait to celebrate with you! 💕✨\n\nRSVP\n\n
 \n\n\n
LAST-MODIFIED:20260804
LOCATION:152 Founders Assembly Hall\, Founders College
PRIORITY:5
TRANSP:OPAQUE
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/love-that-for-you-268/
X-SOURCE:York University
END:VEVENT
